From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jordan Bettcher <thebettcher@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:13:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] [engine] build: opt out of gn's strict include checking (gn
 >= 2591)

gn 52629546 (position 2591, 2026-10-07) made check_includes_strict default
to true for any target with headers. Its commit message says downstream
projects must disable it explicitly in BUILDCONFIG.gn. gn 9fe99e26 (2587)
then stops forwarding private hard_deps on strict targets. Together these
mean that with a current gn (the distro's 0.2595):
  - gn gen --check reports 10 strict-include errors in Flutter's tree;
  - compile steps lose their order-only deps on generated headers, so a
    from-scratch build races: 48 Impeller compiles failed with "file not
    found" while the headers were still being generated.

Set check_includes_strict = false in the defaults for executable,
static_library, shared_library and source_set (component and test
templates expand to these). Measured with system gn 2595: gen --check
clean (0 errors; unpatched tree: 10), and a from-scratch -j64 build of
impeller_unittests, display_list_*, txt_unittests, geometry_unittests and
impellerc has 0 failures, with the same test results as the pinned gn.

Requires gn >= 2489 (bc381971), where the variable was introduced. The
DEPS-pinned gn 81b24e01 (2286) rejects the assignment. gn_version is not
visible in BUILDCONFIG, so the setting cannot be gated on it.

Class: local workaround (upstream Flutter will need the same change when
it rolls gn past 2591; it hasn't yet as of main 2026-11-19).
---
 engine/src/build/config/BUILDCONFIG.gn | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/engine/src/build/config/BUILDCONFIG.gn b/engine/src/build/config/BUILDCONFIG.gn
index 2b0d94e1..305c0957 100644
--- a/engine/src/build/config/BUILDCONFIG.gn
+++ b/engine/src/build/config/BUILDCONFIG.gn
@@ -496,13 +496,21 @@ if (is_win) {
     _executable_configs += [ "//build/config/android:executable_config" ]
   }
 }
+# gn >= 2591 (52629546) defaults check_includes_strict to true, and strict
+# targets stop forwarding private hard_deps (9fe99e26), which drops the
+# order-only deps on generated headers. Opt out on every native target type.
+# Requires gn >= 2489, where the variable was introduced (bc381971); older gn
+# rejects the assignment. gn_version is not visible in BUILDCONFIG to gate it.
+
 set_defaults("executable") {
   configs = _executable_configs
+  check_includes_strict = false
 }
 
 # Static library defaults.
 set_defaults("static_library") {
   configs = _native_compiler_configs
+  check_includes_strict = false
 }
 
 # Shared library defaults (also for components in component mode).
@@ -515,6 +523,7 @@ if (is_win) {
 }
 set_defaults("shared_library") {
   configs = _shared_library_configs
+  check_includes_strict = false
 }
 if (is_component_build) {
   set_defaults("component") {
@@ -525,6 +534,7 @@ if (is_component_build) {
 # Source set defaults (also for components in non-component mode).
 set_defaults("source_set") {
   configs = _native_compiler_configs
+  check_includes_strict = false
 }
 if (!is_component_build) {
   set_defaults("component") {
